<title>UK: Mid Kent FY profits ahead despite sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mid Kent FY profits ahead despite sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		59.6		   vs 58.7</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 30.0		   vs 24.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     13.8		   vs 12.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   40.9		   vs 41.4</p>
<p>NOTE - The water company said it would concentrate on &quot;continuing with the significant improvements it has already achieved, with the e objective of sustaining the strongly improved operational and financial position of the group.&quot;</p>
<p>Full company name - Mid Kent Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
